('e1731ec5-1a15-58e8-a376-714bd6c53cd0', '7d22edfc-44c4-4846-9769-292936cb7827', '7ea4a576-84c8-4a0f-9474-20a442190683', 'a-level', '28.9', '9702 coursebook 28.9 · The nature of light: waves or particles?', 7, 7, 'Which observation is explained by the wave model of light but not by a simple particle model?', NULL, 1, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'Interference fringes from two slits', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Fringes need superposition with path differences, a wave property. Mark scheme (1 mark). B1: C (Interference fringes from two slits).', 1, NULL, NULL),
('1064da86-49a0-5116-8bb0-fc1f923913fd', '7d22edfc-44c4-4846-9769-292936cb7827', '7ea4a576-84c8-4a0f-9474-20a442190683', 'a-level', '28.9', '9702 coursebook 28.9 · The nature of light: waves or particles?', 8, 8, 'Which observation needs the particle (photon) model of light?', NULL, 1, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'Electrons are emitted from a metal at once, but only above a threshold frequency', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Threshold behaviour shows energy arrives in quanta hf. Mark scheme (1 mark). B1: A (Electrons are emitted from a metal at once, but only above a threshold frequency).', 1, NULL, NULL),
('010f02d6-aade-5094-80cb-8bee63df45f0', '7d22edfc-44c4-4846-9769-292936cb7827', '7ea4a576-84c8-4a0f-9474-20a442190683', 'a-level', '28.9', '9702 coursebook 28.9 · The nature of light: waves or particles?', 9, 9, 'Light of wavelength 600 nm passes through two slits 0.50 mm apart onto a screen 1.5 m away. Calculate the fringe spacing in mm.', NULL, 1, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.8 mm', 'mm', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'x = λD/a = 600 × 10⁻⁹ × 1.5 ÷ 0.50 × 10⁻³ = 0.00180 m. In mm: 0.001800 × 10³ = 1.80. Mark scheme (2 marks). C1: x = λD/a. A1: x = 1.8 mm.', 2, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 440 250" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg388d6f44-t fg388d6f44-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg388d6f44-t">Two-slit experiment</title><desc id="fg388d6f44-d">Laser light of wavelength 600 nm passes through two slits 0.50 mm apart; bright fringes form on a screen 1.5 m away.</desc><rect x="18" y="104" width="56" height="24" rx="3" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:var(--fig-fill,rgba(29,78,216,0.10));stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="46" y="142" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">laser</text><line x1="74" y1="116" x2="150" y2="116" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="150" y1="34" x2="150" y2="103" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="150" y1="111" x2="150" y2="121" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="150" y1="129" x2="150" y2="200" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="30" x2="382" y2="204" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-line